      "title": "Lecturer (Building Project Management)",
      "description": "Lecturer (Building Project Management) Job Details | Singapore University of Social Sciences Skip to main content SUSS Careers About SUSS Join Talent Community View All Jobs Find Us on LinkedIn Login/View Profile SUSS Careers About SUSS Join Talent Community View All Jobs Find Us on LinkedIn Login/View Profile SUSS Careers About SUSS Join Talent Community View All Jobs Find Us on Linkedin Login/View Profile Search by Keyword Show More Options Loading... Location All School/Department All Job Type All Select how often (in days) to receive an alert: Create Alert × Select how often (in days) to receive an alert: Apply now » Apply now Start apply with LinkedIn Apply Now Start Please wait... Lecturer (Building Project Management) Who We Are Singapore University of Social Sciences is one of Singapore's six autonomous universities and its mission is to provide lifelong education that equips learners to serve society. Home to more than 15,000 students, SUSS provides an applied education that targets both fresh school leavers and adult learners, with a focus on the social sciences. It adopts a flexible and practice-focused learning approach and offers more than 70 degree programmes in various disciplines. Applications are invited for an open-rank faculty position in the area of Project Management at the Singapore University of Social Sciences. The successful candidate will join the Built Environment Cluster in the School of Science and Technology and will be expected to teach and conduct research in Project Management/Cost Management and/or other closely related fields. Job Requirements Ph.D. degree holder in Built Environment or a relevant Engineering, such as Mechanical and Electrical engineering discipline. Candidates with strong knowledge, research and industry experiences in Integrated Digital Delivery will have an added advantage. Strong interest to conduct teaching and research in Built Environment disciplines. Evidence of high-quality publications in international peer-reviewed journals and conferences. Ability to work collaboratively and engage positively with colleagues and external stakeholders. What Do We Offer At SUSS, we advocate the Spirit of Learning and pride ourselves as lifelong learners. You will gain access to various learning platforms and plenty of development opportunities to support your growth in a meaningful career! Besides that, you will also get: Competitive Pay Package Hybrid Work Arrangements (Subject to Job Role) Medical Benefits Flex Benefits Family Care Leaves Volunteer Service Leaves Wellness & Recreation Activities Lifelong Learning Opportunities Career Development Opportunities through Internal Job Postings and Transfers Apply now » Apply now Start apply with LinkedIn Apply Now Start Please wait... Find similar jobs: View All Jobs, Academic Appointments Home SUSS Careers About SUSS Join Talent Community View All Jobs Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. © 2020 Singapore University of Social Sciences. All rights reserved."
