o work collaboratively and engage positively with colleagues and external stakeholders, we warmly welcome you to join us. The successful applicant will join the Marketing discipline in the School of Business (SBIZ). The responsibilities of SBIZ full-time faculty members include teaching, managing and developing courses, conducting academic and/or applied research, and being involved in activities in the service of SUSS and also outside of SUSS that may include outreach to industry and also involvement in industry projects. Job Requirements Ph.D. degree holder in a relevant discipline. Ph.D. applicants nearing completion will also be considered. Applicants with teaching and/or working experience in the relevant areas will have an added advantage. Apply now » Apply now Start apply with LinkedIn Apply Now Start Please wait... Find similar jobs: View All Jobs, Academic Appointments Home SUSS Careers About SUSS Join Talent Community View All Jobs Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. © 2020 Singapore University of Social Sciences. All rights reserved."
